{
  "slug": "statutory-reporting-plugin",
  "name": "Statutory Reporting Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate statutory financial statements from Trial Balances covering IFRS, US Gaap, Ind AS and Indian GAAP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `disclosure-notes` (Generate notes to financial statements following Ind AS, IFRS, or US GAAP requirements), `financial-statements` (Generate complete statutory financial statements in Excel from a classified Trial Balance), `forensic-review` (Review financial statements for errors, inconsistencies, red flags, and compliance issues), `tb-classification` (Classify Trial Balance accounts into statutory financial statement line items)\n- **Commands** (2): `financials` (Generate statutory financial statements from a Trial Balance), `review-financials` (Review financial statements for errors, inconsistencies, and compliance issues)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install statutory-reporting-plugin@claude-community` from `jupitexai/statutory-reporting-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
